@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-nouns`
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-p1-general`
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-p1-cover`
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-p1-settlement`

-- Fixtures for the tests: builders of policies, losses, conduct, assessments and claims.
-- No assertions here. L4 has no record update, so each builder takes as parameters the
-- fields a test varies, and the `standard ...` shortcuts fix the rest.
--
-- THE STANDARD CASE, chosen so that the arithmetic can be done by hand:
--   a passenger car first registered in Vietnam in June 2024, contract concluded in January
--   2026 (19 months in use, so no depreciation: Art 13.1.2.2 row "under 3 years");
--   sum insured 500.000.000 and market value at conclusion 500.000.000 (no under-insurance);
--   insurance period 1 January to 31 December 2026, no hours stated (365 days);
--   premium 10.950.000 (30.000 a day), paid in one instalment due 1 January 2026;
--   deductible 1.000.000 a loss; no supplementary clause; Part 2 taken for 5 persons at
--   100.000.000 each.
-- None of these figures is the document's: they are scenario values, the way a policy
-- schedule would supply them. Every figure the document itself prints that a test relies
-- on is named beside the assertion.

§ `Test fixtures`

§§ `Vehicles`

GIVEN k  IS A `A kind of vehicle`
      c  IS A `What the vehicle carries`
      rm IS A `A calendar month`
      im IS A BOOLEAN
      ym IS A NUMBER
      pl IS A NUMBER
      pp IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`the vehicle: kind` k `, carrying` c `, first registered` rm `, imported used` im `, made in` ym `, permitted load` pl `, permitted persons` pp MEANS
    `A vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                                        IS k
        `requiring a driving licence`                                 IS TRUE
        `use`                                                         IS `not for business`
        `carries`                                                     IS c
        `month of first registration in Vietnam`                      IS rm
        `imported after use abroad`                                   IS im
        `year of manufacture`                                         IS ym
        `permitted load on the inspection certificate`                IS pl
        `permitted number of persons on the inspection certificate`   IS pp

GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A calendar month`
`month` m `of` y MEANS
    `A calendar month` WITH `year`  IS y
                            `month` IS m

GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`the standard car` MEANS
    `the vehicle: kind` `a passenger car` `, carrying` `persons` `, first registered` (`month` 6 `of` 2024) `, imported used` FALSE `, made in` 2024 `, permitted load` 500 `, permitted persons` 5

GIVEN rm IS A `A calendar month`
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`a car first registered in` rm MEANS
    `the vehicle: kind` `a passenger car` `, carrying` `persons` `, first registered` rm `, imported used` FALSE `, made in` 2015 `, permitted load` 500 `, permitted persons` 5

GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`the standard truck` MEANS
    `the vehicle: kind` `a truck` `, carrying` `goods` `, first registered` (`month` 6 `of` 2024) `, imported used` FALSE `, made in` 2024 `, permitted load` 10_000 `, permitted persons` 2

GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`the standard pickup, carrying goods and persons` MEANS
    `the vehicle: kind` `a pickup` `, carrying` `goods and persons` `, first registered` (`month` 6 `of` 2024) `, imported used` FALSE `, made in` 2024 `, permitted load` 1_000 `, permitted persons` 5

GIVEN k IS A `A kind of vehicle`
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`a vehicle of kind` k MEANS
    `the vehicle: kind` k `, carrying` `persons` `, first registered` (`month` 6 `of` 2024) `, imported used` FALSE `, made in` 2024 `, permitted load` 500 `, permitted persons` 5

§§ `Policies`

GIVETH AN `An insurance period`
`the 2026 period, no hours stated` MEANS
    `An insurance period` WITH
        `start date` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `start time` IS NOTHING
        `end date`   IS YMD 2026 12 31
        `end time`   IS NOTHING

GIVEN d  IS A DATE
      a  IS A NUMBER
      pd IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A premium instalment`
`an instalment due` d `of` a `, paid by then` pd MEANS
    `A premium instalment` WITH
        `due date`                    IS d
        `amount due`                  IS a
        `amount paid by the due date` IS pd

GIVETH A LIST OF `A premium instalment`
`the premium paid in one instalment` MEANS
    LIST `an instalment due` (YMD 2026 1 1) `of` 10_950_000 `, paid by then` 10_950_000

GIVETH A `The cover under Part 2`
`the standard Part 2 cover` MEANS
    `The cover under Part 2` WITH
        `sum insured per person`    IS 100_000_000
        `number of persons insured` IS 5

-- The master builder.
GIVEN v   IS A `A vehicle`
      si  IS A NUMBER
      mv  IS A NUMBER
      cm  IS A `A calendar month`
      ip  IS AN `An insurance period`
      is  IS A LIST OF `A premium instalment`
      ow  IS A BOOLEAN
      ded IS A `A deductible`
      cs  IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
      t   IS A MAYBE `A unilateral termination`
      tr  IS A MAYBE `A transfer of ownership`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the policy on` v `, insuring` si `of a value of` mv `, concluded in` cm `, for` ip `, instalments` is `, owing allowed` ow `, deductible` ded `, clauses` cs `, termination` t `, transfer` tr MEANS
    `A policy` WITH
        `the vehicle`                                                        IS v
        `the sum insured`                                                    IS si
        `the market value of the vehicle when the contract was concluded`    IS mv
        `the month the contract was concluded`                               IS cm
        `the insurance period`                                               IS ip
        `the premium`                                                        IS 10_950_000
        `the premium instalments`                                            IS is
        `an agreement by UIC that the premium may be owed`                   IS ow
        `the deductible`                                                     IS ded
        `the supplementary clauses taken`                                    IS cs
        `a unilateral termination`                                           IS t
        `a transfer of ownership`                                            IS tr
        `the cover under Part 2`                                             IS JUST `the standard Part 2 cover`
        `the cover under Part 3 taken`                                       IS FALSE

GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy` MEANS
    `the policy on` `the standard car` `, insuring` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000) `, clauses` EMPTY `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

GIVEN v IS A `A vehicle`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy on` v MEANS
    `the policy on` v `, insuring` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000) `, clauses` EMPTY `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

GIVEN cs IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy taking` cs MEANS
    `the policy on` `the standard car` `, insuring` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000) `, clauses` cs `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

GIVEN si  IS A NUMBER
      mv  IS A NUMBER
      ded IS A `A deductible`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard car insured for` si `of a value of` mv `, deductible` ded MEANS
    `the policy on` `the standard car` `, insuring` si `of a value of` mv `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` ded `, clauses` EMPTY `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

GIVEN is IS A LIST OF `A premium instalment`
      ow IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy with instalments` is `, owing allowed` ow MEANS
    `the policy on` `the standard car` `, insuring` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` is `, owing allowed` ow `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000) `, clauses` EMPTY `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

GIVEN ip IS AN `An insurance period`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy for the period` ip MEANS
    `the policy on` `the standard car` `, insuring` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` ip `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000) `, clauses` EMPTY `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

GIVEN t IS A `A unilateral termination`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy ended by` t MEANS
    `the policy on` `the standard car` `, insuring` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000) `, clauses` EMPTY `, termination` (JUST t) `, transfer` NOTHING

GIVEN tr IS A `A transfer of ownership`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy with the transfer` tr MEANS
    `the policy on` `the standard car` `, insuring` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000) `, clauses` EMPTY `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` (JUST tr)

-- The standard policy, but without Part 2 and with Part 3.
GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy without Part 2, with Part 3` MEANS
    `A policy` WITH
        `the vehicle`                                                        IS `the standard car`
        `the sum insured`                                                    IS 500_000_000
        `the market value of the vehicle when the contract was concluded`    IS 500_000_000
        `the month the contract was concluded`                               IS `month` 1 `of` 2026
        `the insurance period`                                               IS `the 2026 period, no hours stated`
        `the premium`                                                        IS 10_950_000
        `the premium instalments`                                            IS `the premium paid in one instalment`
        `an agreement by UIC that the premium may be owed`                   IS FALSE
        `the deductible`                                                     IS `a deductible per loss of` 1_000_000
        `the supplementary clauses taken`                                    IS EMPTY
        `a unilateral termination`                                           IS NOTHING
        `a transfer of ownership`                                            IS NOTHING
        `the cover under Part 2`                                             IS NOTHING
        `the cover under Part 3 taken`                                       IS TRUE

§§ `Damaged parts`

GIVEN pt IS A `A part of the vehicle`
      fm IS A BOOLEAN
      c  IS A `A cause of damage to a part`
      r  IS A NUMBER
      n  IS A NUMBER
      br IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`a part:` pt `, fitted by the manufacturer` fm `, damaged by` c `, repair` r `, new` n `, beyond repair` br MEANS
    `A damaged part` WITH
        `description`                               IS "a damaged part"
        `part`                                      IS pt
        `fitted by the manufacturer`                IS fm
        `cause`                                     IS c
        `reasonable repair cost`                    IS r
        `replacement cost`                          IS n
        `beyond repair on the technical assessment` IS br

-- An ordinary part damaged by the insured event, repaired.
GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`an ordinary part costing` r `to repair and` n `new` MEANS
    `a part:` `an ordinary part` `, fitted by the manufacturer` TRUE `, damaged by` `the insured event` `, repair` r `, new` n `, beyond repair` FALSE

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`an ordinary part beyond repair, costing new` n MEANS
    `a part:` `an ordinary part` `, fitted by the manufacturer` TRUE `, damaged by` `the insured event` `, repair` 0 `, new` n `, beyond repair` TRUE

GIVEN pt IS A `A part of the vehicle`
      c  IS A `A cause of damage to a part`
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`a manufacturer's` pt `damaged by` c MEANS
    `a part:` pt `, fitted by the manufacturer` TRUE `, damaged by` c `, repair` 2_000_000 `, new` 5_000_000 `, beyond repair` FALSE

GIVEN pt IS A `A part of the vehicle`
      c  IS A `A cause of damage to a part`
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`an after-market` pt `damaged by` c MEANS
    `a part:` pt `, fitted by the manufacturer` FALSE `, damaged by` c `, repair` 2_000_000 `, new` 5_000_000 `, beyond repair` FALSE

-- The standard damage: a bumper repaired (8.000.000; new 12.000.000, so 8 is not more than
-- 70% of 12) and a headlamp beyond repair (new 6.000.000).
GIVETH A LIST OF `A damaged part`
`the standard damage` MEANS
    LIST `an ordinary part costing` 8_000_000 `to repair and` 12_000_000 `new`
       , `an ordinary part beyond repair, costing new` 6_000_000

§§ `Drivers`

GIVEN lic IS A `A driving licence status`
      al  IS A BOOLEAN
      dr  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A driver`
`a driver with` lic `, alcohol` al `, drugs` dr MEANS
    `A driver` WITH
        `licence`                              IS lic
        `alcohol in blood or breath`           IS al
        `using narcotics or banned stimulants` IS dr

GIVETH A `A driver`
`a sober licensed driver` MEANS
    `a driver with` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle` `, alcohol` FALSE `, drugs` FALSE

§§ `Losses`

GIVEN hr IS A NUMBER
      mn IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A time of day`
`the time` hr `h` mn MEANS
    `A time of day` WITH `hour`   IS hr
                         `minute` IS mn

-- The master builder.
GIVEN d   IS A DATE
      t   IS A `A time of day`
      iv  IS A BOOLEAN
      e   IS AN `An event`
      o   IS AN `An origin of the damage`
      su  IS A BOOLEAN
      tp  IS A BOOLEAN
      cs  IS A LIST OF `A circumstance of the loss`
      dr  IS A MAYBE `A driver`
      s   IS A NUMBER
      lim IS A NUMBER
      ld  IS A NUMBER
      np  IS A NUMBER
      xs  IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
      est IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A loss`
`the loss on` d `at` t `, in Vietnam` iv `, by` e `, origin` o `, sudden` su `, third party` tp `, circumstances` cs `, driver` dr `, speed` s `limit` lim `, load` ld `persons` np `, parts` xs `, estimate` est MEANS
    `A loss` WITH
        `date of the loss`         IS d
        `time of the loss`         IS t
        `in Vietnam`               IS iv
        `event`                    IS e
        `origin`                   IS o
        `sudden and unforeseeable` IS su
        `involving a third party`  IS tp
        `circumstances`            IS cs
        `driver`                   IS dr
        `speed`                    IS s
        `speed limit`              IS lim
        `load carried`             IS ld
        `persons carried`          IS np
        `damaged parts`            IS xs
        `estimated damage`         IS est

-- A collision on 10 June 2026 at 10:00 in Vietnam, an accident, sudden and unforeseeable, no
-- third party, a sober licensed driver at 50 in a 60 zone, one person, estimate 5.000.000.
GIVEN e  IS AN `An event`
      cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance of the loss`
      xs IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
GIVETH A `A loss`
`a loss by` e `, circumstances` cs `, parts` xs MEANS
    `the loss on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `at` (`the time` 10 `h` 0) `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, by` e `, origin` `an accident` `, sudden` TRUE `, third party` FALSE `, circumstances` cs `, driver` (JUST `a sober licensed driver`) `, speed` 50 `limit` 60 `, load` 0 `persons` 1 `, parts` xs `, estimate` 5_000_000

GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision` MEANS
    `a loss by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, parts` `the standard damage`

GIVEN cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance of the loss`
GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision with` cs MEANS
    `a loss by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, circumstances` cs `, parts` `the standard damage`

GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
GIVETH A `A loss`
`a collision damaging` xs MEANS
    `a loss by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, parts` xs

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      t IS A `A time of day`
GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision on` d `at` t MEANS
    `the loss on` d `at` t `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, origin` `an accident` `, sudden` TRUE `, third party` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, driver` (JUST `a sober licensed driver`) `, speed` 50 `limit` 60 `, load` 0 `persons` 1 `, parts` `the standard damage` `, estimate` 5_000_000

GIVEN dr IS A MAYBE `A driver`
GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision, the driver being` dr MEANS
    `the loss on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `at` (`the time` 10 `h` 0) `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, origin` `an accident` `, sudden` TRUE `, third party` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, driver` dr `, speed` 50 `limit` 60 `, load` 0 `persons` 1 `, parts` `the standard damage` `, estimate` 5_000_000

GIVEN s   IS A NUMBER
      lim IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision at speed` s `in a limit of` lim MEANS
    `the loss on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `at` (`the time` 10 `h` 0) `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, origin` `an accident` `, sudden` TRUE `, third party` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, driver` (JUST `a sober licensed driver`) `, speed` s `limit` lim `, load` 0 `persons` 1 `, parts` `the standard damage` `, estimate` 5_000_000

GIVEN ld IS A NUMBER
      np IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision carrying a load of` ld `and persons` np MEANS
    `the loss on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `at` (`the time` 10 `h` 0) `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, origin` `an accident` `, sudden` TRUE `, third party` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, driver` (JUST `a sober licensed driver`) `, speed` 50 `limit` 60 `, load` ld `persons` np `, parts` `the standard damage` `, estimate` 5_000_000

GIVEN e  IS AN `An event`
      o  IS AN `An origin of the damage`
      su IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A loss`
`a loss by` e `of origin` o `, sudden` su MEANS
    `the loss on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `at` (`the time` 10 `h` 0) `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, by` e `, origin` o `, sudden` su `, third party` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, driver` (JUST `a sober licensed driver`) `, speed` 50 `limit` 60 `, load` 0 `persons` 1 `, parts` `the standard damage` `, estimate` 5_000_000

GIVEN tp  IS A BOOLEAN
      est IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision, third party` tp `, estimate` est MEANS
    `the loss on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `at` (`the time` 10 `h` 0) `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, origin` `an accident` `, sudden` TRUE `, third party` tp `, circumstances` EMPTY `, driver` (JUST `a sober licensed driver`) `, speed` 50 `limit` 60 `, load` 0 `persons` 1 `, parts` `the standard damage` `, estimate` est

GIVETH A `A loss`
`the standard collision abroad` MEANS
    `the loss on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `at` (`the time` 10 `h` 0) `, in Vietnam` FALSE `, by` `a collision or impact, including with an object other than a car` `, origin` `an accident` `, sudden` TRUE `, third party` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, driver` (JUST `a sober licensed driver`) `, speed` 50 `limit` 60 `, load` 0 `persons` 1 `, parts` `the standard damage` `, estimate` 5_000_000

§§ `Conduct after the loss`

GIVEN fs  IS A LIST OF `A failure after the loss`
      es  IS A LIST OF `An excuse`
      inc IS A BOOLEAN
      r1  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      r2  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      q   IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The conduct after the loss`
`the conduct: failures` fs `, excuses` es `, increasing the damage` inc `, rate under 15.1.1.4` r1 `, rate under 15.1.3` r2 `, premium that should have been charged` q MEANS
    `The conduct after the loss` WITH
        `failures`                                  IS fs
        `excuses`                                   IS es
        `the failures increased the damage`         IS inc
        `the rate UIC sets under Article 15.1.1.4`  IS r1
        `the rate UIC sets under Article 15.1.3`    IS r2
        `the premium that should have been charged` IS q

GIVETH A `The conduct after the loss`
`blameless conduct` MEANS
    `the conduct: failures` EMPTY `, excuses` EMPTY `, increasing the damage` FALSE `, rate under 15.1.1.4` NOTHING `, rate under 15.1.3` NOTHING `, premium that should have been charged` NOTHING

GIVEN fs IS A LIST OF `A failure after the loss`
      es IS A LIST OF `An excuse`
GIVETH A `The conduct after the loss`
`conduct with failures` fs `and excuses` es MEANS
    `the conduct: failures` fs `, excuses` es `, increasing the damage` FALSE `, rate under 15.1.1.4` NOTHING `, rate under 15.1.3` NOTHING `, premium that should have been charged` NOTHING

§§ `Assessments`

GIVEN ex  IS A NUMBER
      mvl IS A NUMBER
      c1  IS A NUMBER
      c2  IS A NUMBER
      ins IS A BOOLEAN
      pc  IS A BOOLEAN
      kw  IS A BOOLEAN
      wv  IS A NUMBER
      os  IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      pa  IS A NUMBER
      el  IS A NUMBER
      so  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The assessment of the loss`
`the assessment: extent` ex `, value at the loss` mvl `, costs` c1 `and` c2 `, instructed` ins `, police concluded` pc `, wreck kept` kw `valued at` wv `, other sums insured` os `, already paid` pa `, earlier losses` el `, set off` so MEANS
    `The assessment of the loss` WITH
        `extent of damage on the technical assessment`                       IS ex
        `market value of the vehicle at the time of the loss`                IS mvl
        `cost of preventing further loss`                                    IS c1
        `cost of rescue and transport to the nearest repair place`           IS c2
        `those costs incurred at UIC's request and on its instructions`      IS ins
        `police concluded the theft`                                         IS pc
        `the policyholder asks to keep the wreck`                            IS kw
        `UIC's valuation of the wreck`                                       IS wv
        `sums insured by other insurers for the same vehicle, conditions and events`  IS os
        `compensation already paid in the insurance period`                  IS pa
        `earlier losses in the insurance period`                             IS el
        `UIC sets off unpaid premium`                                        IS so

-- Damage of 10%, market value at the loss 480.000.000, no costs, nothing else.
GIVETH A `The assessment of the loss`
`the standard assessment` MEANS
    `the assessment: extent` (10%) `, value at the loss` 480_000_000 `, costs` 0 `and` 0 `, instructed` FALSE `, police concluded` FALSE `, wreck kept` FALSE `valued at` 0 `, other sums insured` EMPTY `, already paid` 0 `, earlier losses` 0 `, set off` FALSE

GIVEN c1  IS A NUMBER
      c2  IS A NUMBER
      ins IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The assessment of the loss`
`the standard assessment with costs` c1 `and` c2 `, instructed` ins MEANS
    `the assessment: extent` (10%) `, value at the loss` 480_000_000 `, costs` c1 `and` c2 `, instructed` ins `, police concluded` FALSE `, wreck kept` FALSE `valued at` 0 `, other sums insured` EMPTY `, already paid` 0 `, earlier losses` 0 `, set off` FALSE

GIVEN el IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The assessment of the loss`
`the standard assessment after earlier losses` el MEANS
    `the assessment: extent` (10%) `, value at the loss` 480_000_000 `, costs` 0 `and` 0 `, instructed` FALSE `, police concluded` FALSE `, wreck kept` FALSE `valued at` 0 `, other sums insured` EMPTY `, already paid` 0 `, earlier losses` el `, set off` FALSE

GIVEN ex IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The assessment of the loss`
`the standard assessment with an extent of` ex MEANS
    `the assessment: extent` ex `, value at the loss` 480_000_000 `, costs` 0 `and` 0 `, instructed` FALSE `, police concluded` FALSE `, wreck kept` FALSE `valued at` 0 `, other sums insured` EMPTY `, already paid` 0 `, earlier losses` 0 `, set off` FALSE

§§ `Claims`

GIVEN l  IS A `A loss`
      c  IS A `The conduct after the loss`
      a  IS A `The assessment of the loss`
      d  IS A DATE
      n  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim under Part 1`
`the claim for` l `, conduct` c `, assessment` a `, made on` d `, obstacle days` n MEANS
    `A claim under Part 1` WITH
        `the loss`                                            IS l
        `the conduct`                                         IS c
        `the assessment`                                      IS a
        `claim made on`                                       IS d
        `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle`   IS n

-- A claim made ten days after the loss, with blameless conduct and the standard assessment.
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
GIVETH A `A claim under Part 1`
`a claim for` l MEANS
    `the claim for` l `, conduct` `blameless conduct` `, assessment` `the standard assessment` `, made on` (l's `date of the loss` PLUS 10) `, obstacle days` 0

GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      c IS A `The conduct after the loss`
GIVETH A `A claim under Part 1`
`a claim for` l `with conduct` c MEANS
    `the claim for` l `, conduct` c `, assessment` `the standard assessment` `, made on` (l's `date of the loss` PLUS 10) `, obstacle days` 0

GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      a IS A `The assessment of the loss`
GIVETH A `A claim under Part 1`
`a claim for` l `assessed as` a MEANS
    `the claim for` l `, conduct` `blameless conduct` `, assessment` a `, made on` (l's `date of the loss` PLUS 10) `, obstacle days` 0

§§ `Reading an answer`

-- The settlement inside a `payable` answer; any other answer is declined, so that an
-- assertion on it reports a refusal rather than a wrong number.
GIVEN ans IS A `The answer to a claim under Part 1`
GIVETH A `A settlement`
`the settlement in` ans MEANS
    CONSIDER ans
    WHEN `payable` s THEN s
    OTHERWISE REFUSE "the answer is not a payable settlement"

GIVEN ans IS A `The answer to a claim under Part 1`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A reason there is no cover`
`the reasons in` ans MEANS
    CONSIDER ans
    WHEN `not covered` rs THEN rs
    OTHERWISE EMPTY

GIVEN cl IS A `A claim under Part 1`
      p  IS A `A policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount paid out on` cl `under` p MEANS
    s's `amount paid out`
    WHERE
        s MEANS `the settlement in` (`Part 1 — the answer to` cl `under` p)
